LVS regression status
---------------------
The post-ECO Magic-extracted SPICE netlist is byte-identical to the accepted
August 1 reloc8 extraction.  Therefore this routing-only area ECO introduces
no LVS delta and inherits the existing baseline result:

    net count difference = 1
    device count difference = 0
    unmatched nets = 1
    unmatched devices = 0
    unmatched pins = 0
    property failures = 0

Total existing errors = 2

This is connectivity-regression evidence, not a claim that the pre-existing
SRAM-interface LVS mismatch has been fixed.
